Portions derived from CADCraft
------------------------------
Tenon is a fork of CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft) at commit 14e143b.
crates/geom, crates/dxf and xtask originate there; crates/sketch/src/lm.rs is ported from its
crates/constraints/src/lm.rs, and the sketch solver follows its design. crates/drawing/src/stroke.rs
is CADCraft's crates/fonts/src/stroke.rs (its single-stroke drafting font).
